"{ph0}Address:{ph1} a location in the program, written in hexadecimal, such "
"as {ph2}."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Anschrift:{ph1} eine Stelle im Programm, die hexadezimal geschrieben "
"ist, z. B.: {ph2}."

