#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/aegis/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA returns {ph0}the clock conversion, default settings and generating "
"methods.{ph1} The constructors set a 30-second interval and six digits; the "
"timestamp method turns seconds into a block number."
msgstr ""
"REA kehrt zurück {ph0}die Taktumwandlung, Standardeinstellungen und "
"Generierungsmethoden.{ph1} Die Konstruktoren legen ein Intervall von 30 "
"Sekunden und sechs Ziffern fest; Die Zeitstempelmethode wandelt Sekunden in "
"eine Blocknummer um."

#. {ph0}: <span>
#. {ph1}: </span>
#: website/public/showcase/aegis/index.html:494
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/aegis/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}01{ph1} Time block"
msgstr "{ph0}01{ph1} Zeitblock"

#. {ph0}: <span>
#. {ph1}: </span>
#: website/public/showcase/aegis/index.html:502
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/aegis/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}02{ph1} Key + block"
msgstr "{ph0}02{ph1} Schlüssel + Block"

#. {ph0}: <span>
#. {ph1}: </span>
#: website/public/showcase/aegis/index.html:510
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/aegis/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}03{ph1} Six digits"
msgstr "{ph0}03{ph1} Sechs Ziffern"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/showcase/aegis/index.html:569
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/aegis/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Time chooses the block.{ph1} Seconds 30 through 59 all give block 1. At"
" 60 seconds, the block becomes 2."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Die Zeit wählt den Block.{ph1} Die Sekunden 30 bis 59 geben alle Block "
"1 an. Nach 60 Sekunden wird der Block 2."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/showcase/aegis/index.html:575
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/aegis/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}The key matters too.{ph1} The generator combines the account key with "
"the block. An account with a different key can show a different code at the "
"same time."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Auch die Schlüsselfragen.{ph1} Der Generator kombiniert den "
"Kontoschlüssel mit dem Block. Ein Konto mit einem anderen Schlüssel kann "
"gleichzeitig einen anderen Code anzeigen."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/showcase/aegis/index.html:582
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/aegis/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Keep six digits.{ph1} The remainder after division by 1,000,000 is "
"padded with zeroes when needed, so a code can begin with 0."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Behalte sechs Ziffern bei.{ph1} Der Rest nach der Division durch "
"1.000.000 wird bei Bedarf mit Nullen aufgefüllt, sodass ein Code mit 0 "
"beginnen kann."

